    {
     "@es": "**Lecture** = conferencia (no «lectura», que es **reading**). **Sympathetic** = compasivo, comprensivo (no «simpático», que es **nice** o **friendly**). Por eso la frase «My teacher is sympathetic» habla de una profesora comprensiva.",
     "@en": "**Lecture** = conference (not «reading», which is **reading**). **Sympathetic** = compassionate, understanding (not «nice.», which is **nice** or **friendly**). That's why the «My teacher is sympathetic» phrase speaks of a comprehensive teacher."
    }
   ]
